UID:10004402-1783702800-1783717200@events.ackland.org
SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtWalk: Extended Museum Hours
DESCRIPTION:Join us for extended hours at the Ackland Art Museum during the Carrboro-Chapel Hill 2nd Friday ArtWalk! Each month\, we stay open from 5:00 – 9:00 p.m. to give visitors more time to explore. \nAt 6 p.m.\, take a tour of the new exhibition Continental Shift: Recent Acquisitions of African Art with curator Peter Nisbet. Free\, but space is limited; click here to register for your free ticket. \nStroll through our galleries featuring highlights from a collection of over 21\,000 works of art. Sketch in the galleries using free art supplies from our lobby’s art cart. \nAdmission to the Ackland is always free; no prior registration needed. Whether you’re stopping by solo or bringing friends\, come be inspired during our extended open hours!
URL:https://events.ackland.org/event/july20262nd-friday-artwalk-extended-museum-hours/
LOCATION:Ackland Art Museum\, 101 S. Columbia Street\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
CATEGORIES:2nd Friday ArtWalk
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.ackland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1606f354-full-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
